{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-logistics-route-012-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/Logistics/LogisticsHoldPresentationTests.cs", "line": 804, "method": "AllHoldStrings_ArePlainAscii", "category": "T3", "severity": "Low", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/UI/LogisticsHoldPresentation.cs:31; add a clause containing an em dash on a token family not present in the sample list -> stays green; add it to a sampled clause -> red.", "what_it_asserts": "That 37 enumerated DescribeHold / StatusCellText / FormatHoldDetailLine / FormatPartialDeliveryLine results are non-empty and contain only chars <= 127.", "why_weak": "The sample list is hand-maintained, so the guard's exhaustiveness claim in the name and in the class summary ('every produced string') is not mechanically true; a clause added to LogisticsHoldPresentation.cs without a matching sample entry is never scanned.", "proposed_action": "Either rename to SampledHoldStrings_ArePlainAscii, or make it exhaustive by scanning the string literals of Source/Parsek/UI/LogisticsHoldPresentation.cs (a wiring gate over one file) instead of the sample list.", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
